T            Top of the list
N or Return  Next page
P            Previous page
Q            Quit, keeping the items that have an asterisk
QC           Quit, clearing every item
S item       Select item (an asterisk shows it is selected); S may be left out
C item       Clear item
?            This help
An item is a number, a range a-b, VISIBLE (this page) or ALL, which may be shortened to V and A.
Several may be given, separated by a space or a comma: 1,4,8-11
